(4,'en','Amazon Rainforest & Rio Negro','Four days in Manaus and the Anavilhanas Archipelago jungle lodge.',
 '{"best_season":"June to November (dry river beaches) or Dec to May (flooded forest)","estimated_cost":"USD 180-350 per day (jungle lodge full board)","logistics":"Fly into Manaus (MAO). 2.5h transfer by car and speedboat to Novo Airão.","days":[{"day":1,"title":"Manaus to Jungle Lodge","items":["Morning visit to Teatro Amazonas","Speedboat transfer up the Rio Negro","Nocturnal caiman spotting tour"]},{"day":2,"title":"Primary Rainforest Trek","items":["Guided survival and botany trek with native guide","Pink river dolphin observation area","Pink sunset over Rio Negro"]},{"day":3,"title":"Anavilhanas Archipelago by boat","items":["Canoe through flooded labyrinth islands","Indigenous community visit with cultural exchange","Piranha fishing"]},{"day":4,"title":"Meeting of the Waters & Departure","items":["Sunrise birdwatching","Boat excursion to Encontro das Águas (Rio Negro and Solimões)","Transfer back to Manaus airport"]}],"tips":["Mandatory yellow fever vaccination CIVP card","Pack lightweight long-sleeve shirts and high-DEET insect repellent","Carry physical cash for indigenous handicrafts"]}'),
(4,'pt','Floresta Amazônica & Rio Negro','Quatro dias entre Manaus e os lodges de selva de Anavilhanas.',
